@lol was never caught because he has a wife and three kids to lose. He lives a modest life as his cover—just another face in a busy city. Not even his new family or closest friends know the truth. They don’t know about the money. They don’t know about the scams. Behind the scenes, he’s been laundering every dollar he pulled from those schemes, stacking a silent fortune while everyone believes he’s ordinary. Low-key a multimillionaire, he’s already mapped out his future: a clean exit, early retirement, and fifty secluded acres where he’ll own everything outright. No bills. No neighbors. No public schools. Just a family living in peace on a mountain top!

He did it because he wanted absolute freedom—freedom from bosses, from rules, from anyone who could ever tell him what to do ever again...

Tell me how I know…
